# Torvus Bog 08_swamp_grappleguardian layers 2/4/7: eight Bloggs (u0654 u0651 u064d u0649 u0646 u0641
# u05c5 u05be). God-mode player in the water fights them, missiles/charged shots, then kills.
# Plus morph/unmorph cycles with Bloggs in reach (ShouldEndBallPursuit, PlayerInBallMode) and a
# Water probe. For tools/cov/specs/blogg_force2.py (force_ret.py) in 08_swamp_grappleguardian.
